  sentences:
    nameNPC: "T\xF4i"
    Lines:
    - "(V\u1ED7 vai \u0110i\u1EC1n) Ph\u1EA3i! L\xE0ng m\xE0y v\xE0 l\xE0ng tao s\u1EBD
      l\xE0 m\u1ED9t. Ta v\xE0 m\xE0y c\xF9ng l\xE0m t\u01B0\u1EDBng. Ch\xFAng ta
      s\u1EBD c\xF9ng nhau chi\u1EBFm ng\u1ECDn \u0111\u1ED3i kia, c\xF9ng nhau l\xE0m
      ch\u1EE7 c\u1EA3 v\xF9ng n\xE0y."
    - " \u0110\u1EBFn l\xFAc \u0111\xF3, kh\xF4ng ch\u1EC9 c\xF3 mu\u1ED1i, m\xE0
      c\u1EA3 c\xE1 d\u01B0\u1EDBi s\xF4ng, qu\u1EA3 tr\xEAn c\xE2y, ch\xFAng ta
      \u0111\u1EC1u chia \u0111\u1EC1u. Nh\u01B0 v\u1EADy kh\xF4ng t\u1ED1t h\u01A1n
      sao?"
